  m_text: "<size=20>- Bonus symbols on reels 1, 3 and 5 triggers\n   the                                 .\n-
    15 Inferno balls are randomly drawn from the Inferno \n   Machine. \n- 15 Inferno
    balls each reveals a prize.\n- Diamond Inferno balls award Jackpots. \n- Yellow,
    Red, Green and Blue Inferno balls award coin \n  prizes or +1 Spins.\n- The Inferno
    Ball Wheel spins to determine the color of   \n   the Inferno balls user wins.\n
    \          - If the won Inferno balls include a +1 Spin, Inferno   \n             Wheel
    will spins once more.\n- User wins the sum amount of all Jackpots and coin \n
    \ prizes on the won Inferno balls. \n"
