  m_text: "<size=20>- 3 Free Games symbols on Reels 2, 3 and 4 triggers Free \n  Games.\n-
    Number of Free Games is determined by the Free Spins   \n  Wheel\n  spin. \n-
    During Free Games, 3 Free Games symbols on reels 2, 3, and \n  4 re-triggers free
    spin wheel.\n- Free Spins Wheel will spin once more to determine the \n  number
    of additional free spins.\n"
